Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Ils n'étaient\Npas venus
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.94,0:00:02.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}les mains vides.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.22,0:00:03.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Ils apportaient\Ndes secrets que
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.98,0:00:05.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}l'homme n'aurait\Njamais dû connaître.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.98,0:00:08.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Azazel enseigna\Naux hommes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.47,0:00:09.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}à forger des épées,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.87,0:00:12.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}des boucliers et\Ndes cuirasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.54,0:00:14.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Le premier cours de\Nforge de l'histoire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.95,0:00:16.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Sans consignes\Nde sécurité.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:19.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Il leur montra l'or et
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.21,0:00:21.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}l'argent cachés\Ndans la terre.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.46,0:00:22.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Et les hommes\Ndécouvrirent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.78,0:00:24.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}un sentiment\Nnouveau :
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.22,0:00:24.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}l'envie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:30.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Aux femmes, il\Napprit les bracelets,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.08,0:00:31.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}les pierres\Nprécieuses et le
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.38,0:00:33.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}fard pour les yeux.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:35.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Le même jour\Nque les épées.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:36.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Rien ne pouvait\Nmal tourner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.69,0:00:42.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Shemihaza enseigna\Nles enchantements
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.78,0:00:43.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}et les racines.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.31,0:00:44.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}D'autres\Nrévélèrent les
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.69,0:00:45.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}signes des étoiles,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:47.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}de la lune\Net du soleil.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.55,0:00:53.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Un berger leva\Nles yeux vers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.79,0:00:55.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}le ciel qu'il avait\Ntoujours aimé…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.78,0:00:57.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}et pour la\Npremière fois,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.05,0:00:58.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}il en eut peur.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:08.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}L'impiété grandit\Nsur la Terre.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.74,0:01:10.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Les voisins devinrent\Ndes rivaux,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.27,0:01:11.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}et les frères,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.13,0:01:11.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}des ennemis.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.19,0:01:22.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Mais le pire\Nrestait à venir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.64,0:01:24.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}Car des unions\Ndes Veilleurs…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.74,0:01:26.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1248)\fad(80,60)}allaient naître\Ndes géants.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.30,0:01:34.10,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\fad(1000,0)}{\fs58\fsp6}ÉPISODE 3{\fs20}\N\N{\fs88\fsp1}La naissance des géants
